OL,3,GNEWSARailway path 'accident blackspot'
OL,4,Aleaves man in coma
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who spent 10 days in a coma after
OL,7,Fhis bike crashed on an uneven section
OL,8,Fof a cycle path has called for urgent
OL,9,Frepairs on the route.
OL,11,FEmanuele Ziglioli, 50, from Bristol,
OL,12,Fsuffered a brain haemorrhage when he
OL,13,Fcrashed on tarmac damaged by tree roots
OL,14,Fon the Bristol and Bath Railway Path
OL,15,Fnear Warmley.
OL,17,FThere are no official figures for
OL,18,Finjuries along the route, but after
OL,19,Fposting about the incident on Facebook,
OL,20,Fdozens of cyclists reported sustaining
OL,21,Finjuries there, with one describing the
OL,22,Fstretch as an "accident blackspot".
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
