OL,3,GNEWSARailway path 'accident blackspot'
OL,4,Aleaves man in coma
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth Gloucestershire Council said
OL,7,Fwarning signs have now been installed
OL,8,Fand repairs will take place "as soon as
OL,9,Fpossible".
